---
title: PDF Export Pipeline
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant input as Internal<br>Galaxy Markdown
    participant handler as ToBasicMarkdown<br>Handler
    participant mdlib as markdown<br>library
    participant sanitize as sanitizer
    participant weasy as WeasyPrint
    participant output as PDF

    input->>handler: Galaxy markdown
    activate handler
    Note right of handler: Fully expands directives:<br>- Tables from datasets<br>- Base64 images<br>- Formatted text
    handler-->>mdlib: basic markdown
    deactivate handler

    activate mdlib
    Note right of mdlib: Standard markdown<br>to HTML conversion
    mdlib-->>sanitize: raw HTML
    deactivate mdlib

    activate sanitize
    Note right of sanitize: Security layer:<br>- Remove scripts<br>- Whitelist tags<br>- Prevent XSS
    sanitize-->>weasy: safe HTML
    deactivate sanitize

    activate weasy
    Note right of weasy: HTML to PDF:<br>- Apply CSS<br>- Render layout<br>- Generate file
    weasy-->>output: PDF bytes
    deactivate weasy
